# AD-366: enforce LF for text/source so a Windows-developed repo never ships
# CRLF to Unix users. The bin entrypoint (cli/index.mjs) shipped with a CRLF
# shebang, which the macOS/Linux kernel parsed as interpreter `node\r` ->
# `env: node\r: No such file or directory`. eol=lf makes Git store and check
# out these files with LF regardless of the developer's core.autocrlf setting.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts  text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
